The '''Dummy''' (木人城 , '''Wooden Castle''') is an animated [[Enemy Bases|Enemy Base]] found in [[Wanderer's Trial (Stage 1)]] in the [[Catclaw Dojo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Dummy
|image = E 283.png
|appearance = [[Catclaw Dojo|Hall of Initiates]]<br>
[[Ranking Dojo]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy base can attack Cat Units in range, with a slow attack rate. Because it is a base, it does not move. All of its attacks are basically an instant-kill, except against [[:Category:Cats with Metal ability|Metal Cats]] and [[:Category:Lethal Strike Resistant Cats|Cats that survive lethal strikes]]. The Dummy is immune to all effects because it is an enemy base.

==Strategy==
Basically any unit that it can outrange, it will kill. Therefore, the best way to counter the Dummy is to use units that outrange it, or time your units so that they go directly before the Dummy attacks so your units can trigger the next wave as fast as possible, as the boss wave knocks your units out of the Dummy's range.

==Variants==
{{Variant
